{"cases":[{"attack":true,"case":"The target names three relations (integration, depends on, abstracts) and satisfies the 'refuted if' form, but the linchpin integration claim is circular rather than substantive: it 'abstracts the additional-pages-beyond-99 framing into an integration of the 99 sub-total pages with the 201 remainder pages, yielding 99 + 201 = 300.' The refutation condition for this integration is 'if the explicit 99 + 201 addition cannot be reduced to the 9 + 90 + 201 computation in the other endpoints.' But 9 + 90 + 201 trivially equals 99 + 201 by arithmetic regrouping (9+90=99), so the stated refuter is vacuous — it can never fire. This means the integration relation is unfalsifiable as posed: the target states an arithmetic tautology as its substantive connection, not a genuine structural dependence on SRC_006. A relation whose 'refuted if' reduces to '2+2≠4' is not a substantive relation per the problem standard; it is a summary dressed as a connection.","target":"d02fc092e467b023f8683d084970556e5c5a11dbf94998211b21df6fcd16a772"}]}